	"The ranked server said no (%d).": "El servidor clasificatorio se negó (%d).",
	"Something went wrong.": "Algo salió mal.",
	"Too many orders at once: some were dropped.": "Demasiadas órdenes a la vez: se descartaron algunas.",
	"This ranked match refused you: %s.": "Esta partida clasificatoria te rechazó: %s.",
	"Player %d is in.": "El jugador %d ha entrado.",
