	"Virginia held: Fairleigh broke the Free Assembly at the fort's gate.": "Virginia resistió: Fairleigh derrotó a la Asamblea Libre ante la puerta del fuerte.",
	"The Hollins families were saved: a loyal village in Virginia.": "Las familias de los Hollins se salvaron: una aldea leal en Virginia.",
